+**Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
+*   **Hardware Support:** The implementation assumes DX11 hardware. Mobile support is uncertain [S1, unofficial].
+*   **CPU Bottleneck:** The density field generation is done on the CPU in the reference implementation. For real applications, `Texture3D` should be replaced with `RenderTexture` to keep the pipeline GPU-friendly [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Ambiguity:** Cases 46, 47, 98, 99, 210, 213, 214, 215 contain saddle points. The standard LUT uses a fixed triangulation, which can cause cracks if adjacent voxels resolve ambiguities differently [S7, S8, unofficial]. This implementation uses the standard LUT [S1, unofficial].
